@host = http://localhost:5090

### Status: which mode is running and how much is indexed
GET {{host}}/

### Indexed documents
GET {{host}}/documents

### Ask a question
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Do we need manager approval before serving a PEP?" }

### Something the documents don't cover
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is the office dress code?" }

### Upload another document (multipart). Easier with curl:
# curl -F "file=@my-policy.md" http://localhost:5090/documents
